            "description": "**参数解释:**\n用户Token,通过调用IAM服务获取用户Token接口获取(响应消息头中X-Subject-Token的值)。\n**约束限制:**\n不涉及\n**取值范围:**\n不涉及\n**默认取值:**\n不涉及",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 32,
            "maxLength": 4096
          },
          {
            "name": "Content-Type",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "内容类型",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "default": "application/json;charset=utf8"
          },
          {
            "name": "project_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "项目ID,对应华为云控制台用户名->我的凭证->项目列表->项目ID",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "enterprise_project_id",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释:**\n您可以通过调用企业项目管理服务(EPS)的查询企业项目列表接口(ListEnterpriseProject)查询企业项目ID。若需要查询当前用户所有企业项目绑定的资源信息,请传参all_granted_eps。\n**约束限制:**\n不涉及\n**取值范围:**\n - 0:代表default企业项目\n - all_granted_eps:代表所有企业项目\n - 其它企业项目ID:长度为36个字符\n\n**默认取值:**\n0",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "ltsconfig_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "lts配置信息id,通过ShowLtsInfoConfig获取",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "UpdateLtsInfoConfigRequestBody",
            "in": "body",
            "description": "全量日志配置请求体",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
